sbpcd:    Linux kernel version 1.1.59, with SCSI+IDE+Soundblaster CD support.
sbpcd:
sbpcd:    This is a Linux kernel with support for the whole family of
sbpcd:    Matsushita/Panasonic CD-ROM drives, as well as full support for SCSI
sbpcd:    devices such as hard drives, tape drives, and SCSI CD-ROM drives. See
sbpcd:    the file 'sbpcd.cfg' for an exact list of included drivers.
sbpcd:
sbpcd:    This kernel also has support for PPP, UMSDOS, CSLIP, Ethernet,
sbpcd:    Ftape, and the PS/2 style mouse (but not other busmouse types).
