xt:       Linux kernel version 1.1.59, with IDE+XT (MFM/RLL) drive support.
xt:
xt:       This is a Linux kernel with support for XT style (MFM/RLL) hard 
xt:       drives.  See 'xt.cfg' for an exact list of included drivers.
xt:
xt:       This kernel also has support for PPP, UMSDOS, CSLIP, Ethernet,
xt:       Ftape, and the PS/2 style mouse (but not other busmouse types).
